{"id":3692,"date":"2025-01-27T12:29:15","date_gmt":"2025-01-27T12:29:15","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/?p=3692"},"modified":"2026-08-07T07:56:39","modified_gmt":"2026-08-07T07:56:39","slug":"how-to-become-data-analyst","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-become-data-analyst\/","title":{"rendered":"How to Become a Data Analyst in 2026 (Beginner\u2019s Guide)"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>So\u2014you aim to become a data analyst. After lots of research, you decided it\u2019s the career for you, or perhaps you keep hearing about this exciting job title and are curious to know more.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Either way, you want to know what a career as a Data Analyst entails and how you can make it happen. Also, you may wonder what the industry is like for newbies and aspiring Data Analysts going into 2026. Are Data Analysts still in demand?<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Well, you have come to the right place. This article is your complete Data Analyst roadmap.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Apart from the specific steps you need to take to become a Data Analyst, this article will also give you a good overview of what a Data Analyst does and show you the most important hard and soft skills you will need to be successful in the field.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What is Data Analytics?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-analytics\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Data analytics<\/a> is the process of examining, cleaning, transforming, and interpreting data to discover valuable insights, draw conclusions, and support decision-making.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It involves the use of various techniques, tools, and methodologies to analyze data sets, extract meaningful patterns, and make informed business or research decisions.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who is Data Analyst?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>A data analyst is a professional who specializes in examining and interpreting data to extract valuable insights, support decision-making, and solve problems. Data analysts work with data from various sources, including databases, spreadsheets, and other structured and unstructured data sets.<\/p>\n\n\n\n    <!-- LOTTIE SCRIPT -->\n    <script src=\"https:\/\/unpkg.com\/@lottiefiles\/lottie-player@latest\/dist\/lottie-player.js\"><\/script>\n\n    <section class=\"wscube-courses mb-2\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h3 class=\"mb-4\">Recommended Professional <\/br> Certificates<\/h3>\n\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel courseOwl\">\n\n                \n                    \n                    <div class=\"course-card card-r rounded-4\">\n\n                        <!-- \u2705 SINGLE MEDIA DIV (FIXED) -->\n                        <div class=\"course-media\"\n                             data-lottie=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/uploads\/images\/courses\/json-images\/data-analyst.json\"\n                             data-fallback=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/themes\/newwscube\/assets\/imges\/Image.png\">\n                        <\/div>\n\n                        <div class=\"card-body\">\n                            <h5>Data Analytics Course with Gen AI<\/h5>\n\n                            <p class=\"rating\">\n                                4.9 \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\n                                (1032)\n                            <\/p>\n\n                            <ul class=\"course-meta\">\n                                <li>\ud83d\udc64 3785 Learners<\/li>\n                                <li>\u23f1 18 Weeks<\/li>\n                            <\/ul>\n\n                            <div class=\"mt-3\">\n                                                                    <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/data-analytics-course?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_course_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\"\n                                       target=\"_blank\"\n            